NUK = built in exactly the same drawing style as OOG — pale off-white round
head and rounded bulb body, bold black outlines, flat cel shading, thin black
line limbs, off-white mitten hands, bare off-white oval feet, two large round
white eyes with three white highlight dots each. Four differences from OOG,
and only four: he is SHORTER and STOCKIER, about three quarters of OOG's
height with a wider body; his dark brown hair is flat and hangs down over his
forehead almost into his eyes, with no tuft on top; his eyebrows are thicker
and permanently lowered into a doubtful frown; and he wears a single ragged
brown fur piece over both shoulders like a cape, with no belt and no skirt.
He almost always carries a short knobbly wooden stick in one hand.
